message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ExplicitGuidedWaves: explicit finite element solver for transient torsional guided waves in pipes with localized defects"
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: MIT
authors:
  - given-names: Alexander
    family-names: Narváez
    affiliation: "Mechanical Engineering Department, Technological University of Bolívar, Cartagena, Colombia"
  - given-names: Éder Lima
    name-particle: de
    family-names: Albuquerque
    affiliation: "Department of Mechanical Engineering, University of Brasília, Brasília, Brazil"
  - given-names: Lucas Silveira
    family-names: Campos
    affiliation: "Department of Mechanical Engineering, Federal University of Espírito Santo, Vitória, Brazil"
