keywords:
  - guided waves
  - pipes
  - explicit finite element method
  - elastodynamics
  - Gridap
  - Julia
abstract: >-
  Explicit finite element solver (Julia, Gridap) for transient torsional guided waves in
  pipes with localized defects: quadratic Lagrange hexahedra, row-sum lumped mass and
  central differences on a half pipe with antisymmetry. It is the open finite element
  reference of the hybrid axisymmetric/3D boundary element paper, validated against the
  closed-form T(0,1) solution and the hybrid boundary element method.
